<title>POLAND: POLAR SA IPO PRICED AT PLN 11.</title>
<headline>POLAR SA IPO PRICED AT PLN 11.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish Securities Commission</p>
<p>(KPW) has cleared for public trade the initial public offering</p>
<p>of household appliance maker Polar SA, the KPW said in a</p>
<p>statement.</p>
<p>The firm's 8.9 million existing shares, all belonging to the</p>
<p>state treasury, have also been approved for trade. The state</p>
<p>will sell 1.845 million of them in a public offering.</p>
<p>Issuer:				   Polar SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  new issue, state shares sale</p>
<p> IPO Priced at (PLN):		  11</p>
<p> State Shares Priced at (PLN)	11*</p>
<p> (Previous) Pricing Range:	   11-15</p>
<p> No of State Shares Offered	  up to 1,845,000</p>
<p> No of New Shares Offered	    5,400,000</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		8,900,000</p>
<p> Lead Manager:			   Bank Handlowy Capital Markets</p>
<p>Centre</p>
<p> Lead Underwriter:		     n.a.</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:			finish investment in cooling</p>
<p>equipment firm, start new line of washing machines</p>
<p>  IPO Tranches	    No Of Shares    Subscription</p>
<p>			     Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Large-investor	  3,500,000		August 11-15</p>
<p> Small-investor	  1,000,000		August 11-20</p>
<p> Employees		   900,000		August 11-20</p>
<p> State share sale	up to 1.845 million  Sept 11-17</p>
<p> Earnings Data (mln PLN)  1997 forecast	    1996</p>
<p> Net profit:		  6.0			  1.22</p>
<p> Sales:			 544.0			499.7</p>
<p>Main Shareholders:</p>
<p> State Treasury	 - 100 pct of shares</p>
<p>Note: * State shares to be sold at a minimum price and allotted</p>
<p>at special Warsaw bourse session due on September 22.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
